    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n64614" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μακκοάω</span></b> , fut. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">άσω [ᾱ</span>], <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be
